# Machinaria crossmod: Rivet Cogsworth (dialogueVillagerKind mechanic)
aetherhaven.dialogue.festival.wintertide.greeting.mechanic.0=Wintertide is a good night to oil the joints and hand out spare parts. I brought a few from the shop.
aetherhaven.dialogue.festival.wintertide.greeting.mechanic.1=A gift does not have to be metal. Sometimes a kind word keeps gears turning too.

aetherhaven.dialogue.festival.wintertide.gift.mechanic.love=This is precision work. Best Wintertide gift I could ask for. Thank you.
aetherhaven.dialogue.festival.wintertide.gift.mechanic.like=Solid choice. I will keep this where I can reach it on cold mornings.
aetherhaven.dialogue.festival.wintertide.gift.mechanic.neutral=I will find a shelf for it. Wintertide is still about the giving.
aetherhaven.dialogue.festival.wintertide.gift.mechanic.dislike=Not quite my usual stock. I will take it anyway. The thought counts.

aetherhaven.dialogue.festival.wintertide.incoming.mechanic=Spare bronze plate and a little oil from my bench. Keep your joints warm out there.
